load @term/seed/code/group
  find group

# A wreath product: a way of combining two groups where one group acts by permuting several copies of the other, the
# symmetry of a structure built from repeated sub-structures (the symmetries of a stack of identical objects, or of a
# rooted tree). The form carries the underlying group built by the wreath construction.
form wreath-product
  link group, like group
